{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08532","headline":"五松山送殷淑 · 李白","name":"五松山送殷淑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秀色发江左，风流奈若何。\n仲文了不还，独立扬清波。\n载酒五松山，颓然白云歌。\n中天度落月，万里遥相过。\n抚酒惜此月，流光畏蹉跎。\n明日别离去，连峰郁嵯峨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}